    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Controlled multi-channel ADC diagnostic. The BSP enables VBAT, VBUS, VSYS, and TDIE together, samples them for two seconds, then restores the caller&apos;s exact REG30 value even if a sample fails. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
